@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This personal demonstration stores your account name, email, phone number and a password hash in the project's SQL Server database. Bookings contain passenger names, selected seats and journey details. Administrator accounts can see booking summaries.</p>
<p>An essential authentication cookie keeps you signed in. The demo does not collect payment card details or process payments. Use sample passenger information while exploring the project.</p>
